# PROJECT: SMART PRODUCTION PLANNER AI
## Complete Application Development Prompt for Google AI Studio – Build Mode

Act as a senior full-stack developer, manufacturing ERP consultant, production planning specialist, inventory analyst, procurement expert, and AI application architect.

Build a professional, fully functional, responsive web application called **SMART PRODUCTION PLANNER AI** for a cooking oil manufacturing company.

This application must help the Production Planning, Stores, Procurement, Finance, and Management teams calculate material requirements for upcoming production plans, evaluate stock availability, identify shortages and excess stock, estimate material costs, prioritize procurement, and generate management-ready reports.

This must be a working application, not just a dashboard mockup or UI prototype.

---

# 1. MAIN OBJECTIVE

Develop an intelligent production planning and raw material requirement planning application.

The user will manually upload three Excel files:

1. Combined SKU Master + BOM Master
2. Store Stock
3. Production Plan

The application must process these files, validate their contents, calculate consolidated raw material and packaging material requirements, compare requirements against available stock, identify shortages and excess quantities, and recommend procurement actions.

The application must support multiple SKUs, multiple BOM components per SKU, and multiple production plans.

All calculations must be accurate, traceable, and transparent.

