### STORE STOCK CALCULATION RULES

Create a stock availability configuration.

Default recommended calculation:

Available Stock = Ready Stock For Production

Display WIP separately. Do not automatically count WIP as immediately usable stock.

Also display:
- Opening Stock
- Receipts
- QC Issues
- Loading Issues
- Packing Issues
- Other Issues
- Total Closing
- WIP
- Total Quantity (WIP & Closing)
- Hold/Reject quantities

Allow the user to select an alternative stock basis if their business process requires it.

The stock basis must be visible in the report so management knows which stock figure was used.

Do not add Ready Stock For Production, Total Closing, and WIP together because these fields may overlap.

Do not double-count stock movements or historical issue columns.

If the chosen stock field is blank, flag it for review rather than silently substituting another stock figure.

